AcousticScattering.jl logo artwork

This notice applies to logo.svg, favicon.svg and favicon.ico in this directory.
It does not change the MIT license for the package source code.

The artwork incorporates the Julia dots from Julia logo graphics:
Copyright (c) 2012-2022 Stefan Karpinski.
Source: https://github.com/JuliaLang/julia-logo-graphics
Original license: https://github.com/JuliaLang/julia-logo-graphics/blob/master/LICENSE.md

The dots have been separated into interacting scatterers and combined with acoustic
wavefronts, decorative pressure-field gradients, a rounded-square background and the
AcousticScattering.jl name. The favicon is a simplified version of this adaptation.
No endorsement by the original designer or Julia project is implied.

